**Handling the `y > 0` constraint:**
If a subarray has no odd elements (all even), then `S = x*b > 0` (since subarray is non-empty), so `S <= 0` automatically excludes all-even subarrays! Wait — a subarray with all even numbers has `S = x*b > 0`, so the condition `S <= 0` is never satisfied. So I just need `P[j+1] <= P[i]`.

